      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Detective Sarah Thompson, leading the investigation, stated, \u201CThis is a deeply tragic and disturbing event. We are working tirelessly to piece together what happened and bring those responsible to justice.\u201D\n\nThe mansion, now cordoned off as a crime scene, had already garnered a dark reputation in the local community. Rumors of a curse have swirled around Crestwood for years, as previous owners of the estate met similarly untimely deaths. Some believe the estate holds sinister secrets, casting a shadow over the tragic events of last night.\n\nAs the investigation continues, residents are urged to stay away from the area. Crestwood Mansion remains a chilling reminder of the horrors that transpired within its walls."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
