--- !u!114 &1287172441
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1287172435}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fbc06644914f52b49a5040ca2451ca7d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1422719738}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 1909464125}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 1567368580}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 1958005032}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Mr. Abraham
    line: Hazil, come in. Have a seat. We need to talk.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "What\u2019s this about, Mr. Abraham? You sounded pretty urgent on the phone."
  - speaker: Mr. Abraham
    line: "I\u2019ve heard some disturbing rumors, Hazil. It\u2019s about the old mansion on the outskirts of town. You know the one I\u2019m talking about?"
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Yeah, the abandoned one. People around here always say it\u2019s haunted or something. Just rumors though, right?"
  - speaker: Mr. Abraham
    line: "That\u2019s what I thought, too. But lately, there\u2019s been talk of strange things happening there. Lights seen at night, sounds coming from inside. And the place doesn\u2019t exactly look\u2026 abandoned anymore."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Lights? Sounds? That\u2019s... weird. But no one lives there, do they?"
  - speaker: Mr. Abraham
    line: As far as we know, no. But people are starting to worry. Some even claim to have seen figures moving around the property.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "So, you think someone\u2019s living there now? Or worse... something else?"
  - speaker: Mr. Abraham
    line: "I don\u2019t know. But I need someone I trust to look into it. Discreetly. That\u2019s why I called you in."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: You want me to check it out?
  - speaker: Mr. Abraham
    line: "You\u2019re smart, capable. I know you can handle this. Just take a look around, see if there\u2019s anything unusual. If you find anything, report back to me immediately. Don\u2019t take any risks, Hazil."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Alright... I\u2019ll do it. But if this is just another ghost story, you owe me for dragging me into this."
  - speaker: Mr. Abraham
    line: Fair enough. But something tells me this is more than just a story. Be careful.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: " I\u2019ll head over there tonight and check it out."
  npcContButton: {fileID: 1604290835}
  playerContButton: {fileID: 1945475596}
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  playerMovement: {fileID: 1637096517}
  inventoryButton: {fileID: 0}
  pauseButton: {fileID: 890914782}
