  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Now, with the Hayes family and their household staff meeting a similarly gruesome fate, a dark legacy has firmly taken root. All were found murdered in their respective bedrooms, hours after hosting a grand gathering. With three families and their servants dead over several decades, many believe that Crestwood Mansion may be cursed\u2014or haunted by an evil that defies explanation.\n\nDetective Sarah Thompson, heading the investigation into the Hayes murders, expressed deep concern over the grim pattern. \u201CIt\u2019s alarming, to say the least. We are not ruling out any possibilities and are determined to uncover the truth, no matter how difficult or terrifying that may be.\u201D\n\nWhile Crestwood Mansion once symbolized wealth and prestige, it now stands as a dark reminder of the unsolved mysteries within its walls. Those brave enough to enter the mansion claim to feel an unnatural presence, watching from the shadows, as if something malevolent still resides there.\n\nAs the investigation into the latest tragedy continues, the burning question remains: What\u2014or who\u2014is responsible for the series of deaths, and will it strike again?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6467807135178674435, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
