      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Headline: Tragedy Strikes: Grisly Murders at Crestwood Mansion


    Date: March 15, 1970


    Article:


    Crestwood Mansion, once a beacon of luxury, has now become the backdrop for a horrifying crime that has sent shockwaves through the community. Authorities have confirmed that local businessman Jonathan Hayes, his family, and the household staff were brutally murdered in their respective bedrooms late last night.


    The gruesome discovery was made after a prestigious gathering hosted by Mr. Hayes, where several prominent townsfolk were in attendance. Witnesses reported hearing unsettling noises from the mansion in the early hours following the event, but by the time authorities arrived, it was too late. The bodies of Mr. Hayes, his wife, and their children were found slain in their bedrooms, along with the mansion''s maids and butler, all victims of the same unspeakable violence.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
